abstract: >-
  Executable research reference for Valued Asymmetric Lambda, with domain-indexed
  memory admission, bounded active and shadow pools, calibrated urgency, explicit
  host-provided adaptation gradients, and reproducible synthetic retrieval tests.
  It does not establish biological equivalence, creativity, or consciousness.
